spans.s:
लघु॑ (f. लघ्वी & लघु) swift, quick, light, easy,
soft, gentle (sound), pleasant;
 insignificant, small, low, mean;
 short
(prosod.), young or younger. — n. adv., w. मन् slight, despise (w.
कृ mock, scoff*).

लघुता f. ˚त्व n. quickness, lightness, freshness,
agility;
 smallness, insignificance, shortness (pros.);
 fickleness,
frivolity;
 humbleness, meanness, contemptibleness.
